    <bpmn:process id="W_W1717" name="W1717. Corporate Resolution Generation &amp; Authentication" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Board or shareholder decision requiring formal resolution; bank/counterparty requiring corporate authorization
Frequency: ~30–50 resolutions/year
Volume: Board resolutions: ~20–30/year; shareholder resolutions: ~5–10/year; management resolutions: ~5–10/year
Owner: Corporate Secretary
Participants: Corporate Secretary, Board Chair, CEO, requesting party
Source: workflow W1717 — Corporate Resolution Generation &amp; Authentication</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1717_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1717_Lane1" name="Corporate Secretary">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1717_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1717_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1717_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1717_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1717_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1717_Lane2" name="Board Chair">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1717_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1717_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1717_Start4" name="Board or shareholder decision requiring formal resolution; bank/counterparty requiring…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1717_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1717_Task5" name="Trigger for resolution: (a) board decision at meeting (extracted from minutes…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Trigger for resolution: (a) board decision at meeting (extracted from minutes per W1716), (b) written consent action (all directors sign without meeting — permitted per Revised Corporation Code for certain matters), (c) bank/counterparty request for authority certification (e.g., signing authority for bank accounts, authority to enter contracts &gt; threshold), (d) regulatory filing requirement (SEC, BIR, LGU)
Responsible (R): Corporate Secretary / Requesting Party
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1717_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1717_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1717_Task6" name="Corporate Secretary drafts resolution: (a) standard format: company name, date…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Corporate Secretary drafts resolution: (a) standard format: company name, date, &quot;WHEREAS&quot; clauses (background/reasons), &quot;RESOLVED&quot; clauses (decision/authorization), (b) resolution types: (i) authority to sign documents, (ii) approval of contracts/transactions, (iii) officer appointments, (iv) capital expenditure authorization, (v) corporate structure changes, (vi) dividend declaration, (vii) bank account management, (viii) annual report approval
Responsible (R): Corporate Secretary
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min–2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1717_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1717_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1717_Task7" name="Resolution authenticated: (a) board resolution: signed by Board Chair and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Resolution authenticated: (a) board resolution: signed by Board Chair and Corporate Secretary, (b) shareholder resolution: signed by stockholders holding required voting power, (c) management resolution: signed by CEO (for delegated authority matters)
Responsible (R): Board Chair / Corporate Secretary / CEO
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1–3 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1717_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1717_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1717_Task8" name="Certified copies issued to requesting parties: (a) bank: certified resolution…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Certified copies issued to requesting parties: (a) bank: certified resolution for account opening/signing authority, (b) vendor: resolution authorizing contract execution, (c) LGU: resolution for business permit application, (d) SEC: resolution for annual filing
Responsible (R): Corporate Secretary
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1717_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1717_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1717_Task9" name="Original resolution filed in corporate records per W1719; resolution register…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Original resolution filed in corporate records per W1719; resolution register updated with number, date, subject, and parties
Responsible (R): Corporate Secretary
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1717_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1717_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1717_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1717_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1717_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-231 (ensure corporate-governance compliance.) | - operational: Corporate Secretary review and approval gate
Owner: Corporate Secretary</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
