    <bpmn:process id="W_W1719" name="W1719. Corporate Record Retention &amp; Document Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Creation of any corporate document (resolutions, minutes, filings, contracts, legal documents)
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~500–1,000 corporate documents/year
Owner: Corporate Secretary
Participants: Corporate Secretary, Legal Counsel, all departments
Source: workflow W1719 — Corporate Record Retention &amp; Document Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1719_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1719_Lane1" name="Corporate Secretary">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1719_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1719_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1719_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1719_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1719_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1719_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1719_Start3" name="Creation of any corporate document (resolutions, minutes, filings, contracts, legal…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1719_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1719_Task4" name="Corporate Secretary maintains corporate record retention schedule per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Corporate Secretary maintains corporate record retention schedule per Philippine law and best practice: (a) articles of incorporation and by-laws — permanent, (b) board and shareholder minutes — permanent, (c) corporate resolutions — permanent, (d) SEC filings — permanent, (e) contracts (material) — 10 years after expiry, (f) legal correspondence — 7 years, (g) corporate governance policies — permanent (with version history), (h) stock and transfer ledger — permanent, (i) officer and director records — permanent
Responsible (R): Corporate Secretary
Accountable (A): Legal Counsel
Duration: Pre-configured</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1719_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1719_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1719_Task5" name="All corporate documents filed in corporate record management system: (a)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: All corporate documents filed in corporate record management system: (a) document number, date, type, subject, entity, (b) electronic copy (scanned original + working copy), (c) physical original stored in fireproof corporate safe at HQ (for signed documents), (d) indexed for search and retrieval, (e) access restricted by document sensitivity
Responsible (R): Corporate Secretary
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min/document</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1719_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1719_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1719_Task6" name="Quarterly: Corporate Secretary audits record completeness: (a) all board…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Quarterly: Corporate Secretary audits record completeness: (a) all board meetings have minutes on file, (b) all resolutions are numbered and indexed, (c) SEC filings are current, (d) stock ledger is up to date, (e) missing documents identified and remediated
Responsible (R): Corporate Secretary
Accountable (A): Legal Counsel
Duration: 1 day/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1719_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1719_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1719_Task7" name="Document destruction: only per retention schedule; requires Corporate Secretary…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Document destruction: only per retention schedule; requires Corporate Secretary and Legal Counsel approval; destruction log maintained permanently
Responsible (R): Corporate Secretary
Accountable (A): Legal Counsel
Duration: As needed</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1719_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1719_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1719_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1719_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1719_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-349 (ensure controlled execution — Board Meeting Management &amp; Corporate Records (PA-36.1).) | - operational: Corporate Secretary review and approval gate
Owner: Corporate Secretary</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
